  <Properties>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[In this session I will present problems programmers of all skill levels face when writing textual code, and how to address them with visual programming. I have prepared a demonstration of a prototype IDE that allows users to define programs using a node graph architecture rather than writing plain text.]]></Value>
    </description>
